libcassandra
------------------------------------------
A C++ wrapper library for the interface to cassandra generated by thrift. This
library is based on the Java client hector.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libcassandra-devel-0.2.91-1bl1
  libcassandra3-0.2.91-1bl1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libgenthrift-devel-0.2.91-1bl1
  libgenthrift3-0.2.91-1bl1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  libthrift-devel-0.25.0-1bl1
  libthrift0.25.0-0.25.0-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libboost-devel-1.66.0-1
  libthrift-devel-0.25.0-1bl1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/matkor/libcassandra

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/matkor/libcassandra/archive/refs/tags/0.2.91.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libcassandra-0.2.91-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libcassandra-0.2.91-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libcassandra-0.2.91-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libcassandra-0.2.91-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libcassandra3-0.2.91-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libcassandra-devel-0.2.91-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libgenthrift3-0.2.91-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libgenthrift-devel-0.2.91-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

